<div class="hero"><div class="w">
<div class="load"><h1>AC band ho gaya?<span>Techno Cool pahunch jayega.</span></h1>
<svg class="uline" viewBox="0 0 290 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9C60 2 110 12 170 6s90-2 117 3" fill="none" stroke="#f4a712" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
<p class="lead">AC repair, installation, servicing and gas refilling across Ahmedabad. Open 24 hours, because the AC never fails at a convenient time.</p>
<div class="cta"><a class="btn" href="tel:+918160623632">Call Anas</a><a class="btn alt" href="https://wa.me/918160623632?text=Hi%20Techno%20Cool%2C%20I%20need%20AC%20service." target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp us</a><span class="hand note">seedha baat karo</span></div>
