<section id="services" class="ice"><div class="w"><h2>What we fix and fit</h2><p class="sub">Homes, shops and industrial units. Tell us what is wrong and we will say honestly whether it needs repair, a service or just a gas top-up.</p>
<div class="grid" id="sg"></div></div></section>

<section id="about"><div class="w two about"><div><h2>A local team, not a call centre</h2>
<p>Techno Cool is run from Jultaminara Road in Gomtipur. When you call, you speak to Anas and the team who will actually come to your door.</p>
<p>We repair and service all types of air conditioners, plus fridges, water coolers, deep freezers and other cooling systems. We also look after 3-phase industrial AC with service and maintenance contracts.</p>
<p>Our Google reviews talk about the same things again and again: polite staff, on time, clean installation. That is the standard we keep.</p><div class="hand sign">– Anas, Techno Cool</div></div>
<div class="sheet"><h3 style="margin-bottom:14px">Annual Service Contract</h3><p>Get your AC serviced on a regular schedule so it cools well and breaks down less when summer is at its worst. Works for homes and for 3-phase industrial units.</p><p>Plans are fitted to your units, so ask us for a quote.</p><a class="btn" href="#contact" data-svc="Annual Service Contract">Ask about a contract</a></div></div></section>

<section id="process" class="ice"><div class="w two"><div><h2>How a visit works</h2><p class="sub">No surprises. You know the problem and the price before any work starts.</p></div>
<ol class="steps"><li><b>Call or WhatsApp</b>Tell us the AC type and what is happening.</li><li><b>Technician visits</b>We inspect the unit properly, indoor and outdoor.</li><li><b>You get a clear quote</b>Work starts only after you agree.</li><li><b>Repair, install or service</b>Done neatly, with the mess cleaned up.</li><li><b>Check and pay</b>We run the AC with you, then you pay. Ask about the service contract.</li></ol></div></section>

<section id="work"><div class="w"><h2>Our work</h2><p class="sub">Real jobs from our technicians. This clip shows the inside of a dirty AC coil, which is why regular servicing matters.</p>
<div class="work"><div style="grid-column:span 1"><video controls preload="metadata" playsinline muted poster="data:image/jpeg;base64,"><source src="data:video/mp4;base64," type="video/mp4"></video><div class="vcap">Dirty coil, before cleaning</div></div>
<figure class="pr" style="position:relative;margin:0;transform:rotate(1.5deg)"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Installed LG split AC" width="229" height="164"><figcaption>Neat wall mount and outdoor unit</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="pr" style="position:relative;margin:0;transform:rotate(-1.5deg)"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Split AC on site" width="243" height="174"><figcaption>On-site service</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

<section id="reviews" class="ice"><div class="w"><h2>What customers wrote on Google</h2><p class="sub">5.0 stars from 104 reviews. These are a few of them, word for word.</p>
<div class="arr"><button id="pv" aria-label="Previous review">&larr;</button><button id="nx" aria-label="Next review">&rarr;</button></div><div class="rev" id="rv" tabindex="0" aria-label="Customer reviews"></div>
